---
import StudioLayout from "../../../layouts/StudioLayout.astro";
const shots=["Taxi sous la pluie","Appartement vide","La porte","Rue","Fenêtre","Départ","Nuit","Silence"];
---
<StudioLayout title="Vidéo" code="VIDEO">
<section class="head"><div><div class="eyebrow">VIDEO LAB // 005</div><h1>GÉNÉRATION & STORYBOARD</h1></div><div class="headmeta">PROVIDER ROUTER<br/>SAFE MODE</div></section>
<div class="notice"><strong>Génération volontairement verrouillée :</strong> aucun appel Agnes/Wan/Vidu n'est simulé et aucune clé API n'est exposée dans le navigateur. Le bouton sera activé lorsque le Worker serveur sera raccordé.</div>
<div class="grid"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><span>STORYBOARD</span><span class="dim">DRAFT</span></div><div class="shot-grid">{shots.map((s,i)=><article class="shot"><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,"0")}</span><div class="shot-preview">EMPTY</div><b>{s}</b><small>NON GÉNÉRÉ</small></article>)}</div></section><aside class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><span>PROVIDERS</span><span class="dim">SERVER REQUIRED</span></div><div class="services"><div class="service"><span>AGNES</span><span>CONFIG PENDING</span></div><div class="service"><span>WAN</span><span class="status standby">DISABLED</span></div><div class="service"><span>VIDU</span><span class="status standby">DISABLED</span></div><div class="service"><span>PAID FALLBACK</span><span>APPROVAL REQUIRED</span></div></div><div class="overview"><button class="studio-button secondary" disabled>GÉNÉRATION NON CONNECTÉE</button></div></aside></div>
</StudioLayout>